---
const {scenario:s}=Astro.props;
---
<section class="route-explorer" aria-label="业务流程逐步导览"><span class="eyebrow">FOLLOW THE HANDOFF / 跟着交接看流程</span><h2>这一站，谁接手？</h2><div class="route-track">{s.steps.map((step,i)=><button class="route-stop" data-step-select={i} aria-pressed={i===0?'true':'false'} aria-controls={'route-preview-'+i}><span>{String(i+1).padStart(2,'0')}</span>{step.title}</button>)}</div><div class="route-position" aria-live="polite">当前第 1 站，共 {s.steps.length} 站 · 点击上方步骤查看交接</div>{s.steps.map((step,i)=><div class="route-preview" id={'route-preview-'+i} hidden={i!==0}><span class="tag">接手岗位 · {step.actor}</span><h3>{step.title}</h3><p>{step.action}</p><dl class="route-fields"><div><dt>01 / 收到什么</dt><dd>{step.input}</dd></div><div><dt>02 / 怎样核对</dt><dd>{step.check}</dd></div>{step.system && <div><dt>03 / 关联系统与记录</dt><dd>{step.system}</dd></div>}<div><dt>{step.system ? '04' : '03'} / 交出什么</dt><dd>{step.output}</dd></div></dl><div class="exception"><strong>如果卡住</strong>{step.exception}</div><a class="text-link" href={'#step-'+i}>查看这一步的完整说明 ↓</a></div>)}<noscript><p>下方时间线提供所有步骤的完整说明。</p></noscript></section>
<script>
document.querySelectorAll<HTMLElement>('.route-explorer').forEach(root=>{const buttons=[...root.querySelectorAll<HTMLButtonElement>('[data-step-select]')];buttons.forEach(button=>button.addEventListener('click',()=>{buttons.forEach(b=>b.setAttribute('aria-pressed',String(b===button)));root.querySelectorAll<HTMLElement>('.route-preview').forEach(p=>p.hidden=p.id!=='route-preview-'+button.dataset.stepSelect);root.querySelector('.route-position')!.textContent='当前第 '+(Number(button.dataset.stepSelect)+1)+' 站，共 '+buttons.length+' 站 · '+button.textContent!.trim();}));});
</script>